# Secrets only. Every non-secret setting belongs in config/local.jsonc.
#
# Config files never contain a credential. They name the env var that holds
# one, so a config file is always safe to read, diff and paste:
#
#   "providers": { "openai": { "api_key": { "env": "AKNO_OPENAI_API_KEY" } } }
#
# A local llama-server / LM Studio / Ollama endpoint needs no key at all, which
# is why the default setup requires nothing in this file.

# AKNO_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
